{"title": "Disguise Self: Masc Strong Drow", "pageid": 22017, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Disguise_Self:_Masc_Strong_Drow", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Illusion spells", "Ritual spells", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disguise_Self_Masc_Strong_Drow.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Disguise_Self_Masc_Strong_Drow.webp/300px-Disguise_Self_Masc_Strong_Drow.webp, /w/images/c/c7/Disguise_Self_Masc_Strong_Drow.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Disguise_Self_Masc_Strong_Drow.webp/300px-Disguise_Self_Masc_Strong_Drow.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Disguise_Self_Masc_Strong_Drow.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Disguise Self: Masc Strong Drow</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 illusion spell</a>. It is a variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/25px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/38px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/50px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disguise Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/25px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">Disguise Self</a>. This spell allows spellcasters to temporarily change their appearance to the strong form of a masculine <a href=\"/wiki/Drow#Seldarine_Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Seldarine Drow</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nDisguise yourself as a drow with a strong masculine body type.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/38px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\">Ritual</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/